{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0859292a9d1605c39511857d95d3e84ee43438bb849c24af04821f1d9fef28e1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"dmae97/omk@4e820f879503 snapshot 5a51db1e1ff93d41","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6ecd1f7c053beeb3789032de28df6dba14865ff3521ffc7f3e3981753fb9f4b4","slc_9c71afc2b65eb72e17055993a44b1679e809683a999e711734b7331b8f53674f"],"source_ids":["src_afa0fa5d99065b0890b8f65785bb6c86"],"text":"The v0.90.9 hardening document is an implementation-ready plan kept as a plan, not evidence that code was applied; the package version was 0.90.8 when written and 0.91.0 in the later snapshot.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1245a5771a276023deebf5ef97c078085c65053a470525938ff3b1eb7389d57a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"dmae97/omk@4e820f879503 snapshot 5a51db1e1ff93d41","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_44fc16606dc7f11dec74231be8973b11f604c3c98e8058444401265cec507aaf","slc_f3c7f0c944f24174b0c72e94f7f9fb57a9abdd0b041f53035f77070f364e3836"],"source_ids":["src_afa0fa5d99065b0890b8f65785bb6c86"],"text":"The contiguous wave scheduler is safe but causes head-of-line blocking: one earlier conflict delays later independent calls, and path comparison does not detect symlink, hardlink, realpath, or Windows drive/UNC identity aliases.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1d3485a52a1a6a798a06d10845894129936f1c6d6504ff4f1deda02f12ad1a36","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"dmae97/omk@4e820f879503 snapshot 5a51db1e1ff93d41","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9586c74aef688ff0c9f4f14c142d49879460ac81144677c01992d60c5989b484","slc_dac496855bc8303e852ee99d92a396a3d9084720c88ed7740e892c4e70a24b33"],"source_ids":["src_afa0fa5d99065b0890b8f65785bb6c86"],"text":"ALG-003 is reported complete (15/15) as of 2026-07-23, including a Git workspace fingerprint (head plus dirty-diff digest), post-receipt latest-mutation evidence invalidation, and command-string secret redaction with a secure command hash.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5f183e0a5e4b487d902413a3601a9eda8dba391d25c7923010f80c6651ecaa1c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"dmae97/omk@4e820f879503 snapshot 5a51db1e1ff93d41","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_cecae623be97a1d73df6bc67eeb10c47a109ad140a26eff943adbc0ccebb9b4f"],"source_ids":["src_afa0fa5d99065b0890b8f65785bb6c86"],"text":"The current continuation guard only checks whether the last message is an assistant message containing tool calls, so a transcript ending in a toolResult can pass while earlier calls remain unresolved.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8fd7762e9bc932b52183b1c2ad7baaf23ca0ee47ee359d68f34345ccb25e6075","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"dmae97/omk@4e820f879503 snapshot 5a51db1e1ff93d41","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2f80f3cc32a1722efac7c6d0a45feb28d133553b61e7d195a286dcb5a08b2228"],"source_ids":["src_afa0fa5d99065b0890b8f65785bb6c86"],"text":"Only the CI callsite is wired to the receipt executor: ci.yml invokes dist/verify-ci.js, which runs release-consistency commands via executeVerifiedLocalBash with executor 'ci-runner'; CLI, interactive, RPC, and AgentSession bash paths remain unconnected.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e31c9aafda0fb46551d24a8d21983711be7e1552d47ae7c28f3bdb56dbe6771a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"dmae97/omk@4e820f879503 snapshot 5a51db1e1ff93d41","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9586c74aef688ff0c9f4f14c142d49879460ac81144677c01992d60c5989b484","slc_ad48e4661f20f5aa90557c2eab96d6ea16fa30358bc6033753775c5e56ecaa2b"],"source_ids":["src_afa0fa5d99065b0890b8f65785bb6c86"],"text":"Repository development practice: the 2026-07-23 snapshot's verification evidence is limited to focused tests (112/112) and 'npm run check' exit 0; it explicitly does not claim full builds, ./test.sh, ./omk-test.sh, npm pack, or platform smoke results.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e44b4c5230ddfcefd4167b2ad36e7fef8185b04a73154162cb52543bab3f12ca","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"dmae97/omk@4e820f879503 snapshot 5a51db1e1ff93d41","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b2c89ecc55316ecfedd6ac7ca772572c0296c2f5498859a26f3aec33f7741319","slc_c0f4f6a5e2584c1d09d8a2525eb0b285da7a85fea1cc63404dbcb40869bc2a07"],"source_ids":["src_afa0fa5d99065b0890b8f65785bb6c86"],"text":"The evidence gate currently verifies metadata presence (status, hash, verification command) rather than proving a command actually ran, its exit code, the workspace revision, or that artifacts stayed unchanged after execution.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_eba337909e5e4762ce0026e3cb90511d36907a4b4c1fd358e16c2c3ce48f61e0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"dmae97/omk@4e820f879503 snapshot 5a51db1e1ff93d41","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_49868d970939486ac1a04d54563fb36d977affe738a3cfa145d3291478584bee","slc_4aada64c48471b4a95e5fd5c6ae4a1f5c92ae8fbe53d942acfea88ed21f826e9"],"source_ids":["src_afa0fa5d99065b0890b8f65785bb6c86"],"text":"Per the patch analysis, aborting during sequential or wave tool execution can leave later tool calls in the transcript without matching tool results, since the loop breaks and returns only completed results.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f13b6d368aeefd54a0fb803d4300ae3e8a280efeb9a3bf48e958ad5cde6cab31","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"dmae97/omk@4e820f879503 snapshot 5a51db1e1ff93d41","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0ed5e3edee11f3d1f1b602411d356b05d4a531118711d6b1f79d6fcee5efe83f","slc_b593cfad55cfd4dd314557d23cfd1ec124c3ae145e1e3db9b81521286d2e2eea","slc_e01be0e2357b136168a4aae99338b19d503eb4d18c17afb24bc26cde1c41fdb0"],"source_ids":["src_afa0fa5d99065b0890b8f65785bb6c86"],"text":"The planned ALG-001 invariant requires every assistant tool call to have exactly one terminal result with a disposition of completed, failed, blocked, aborted, timeout, or skipped, with synthetic results for never-started calls.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f87fb44387e59c1e78a89c5e22cb753b06881fd468a0f786bbe48949e94cc514","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"dmae97/omk@4e820f879503 snapshot 5a51db1e1ff93d41","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3cb7831a636162c10d6e3daa72ff0f1839ba9a760dcf3fb51f3775c57a81259c"],"source_ids":["src_afa0fa5d99065b0890b8f65785bb6c86"],"text":"OMK runs with the invoking user's process privileges, so its scheduler and evidence gate are explicitly not security boundaries; strong isolation is delegated to containers, micro-VMs, or sandboxes.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_96efcb11a8f344dfad6e03ea65b72dca"}
